# Placeholder video assets

Add production video files here:

- `opening-cinematic.mp4` — slow, moody horizon / abstract future imagery (Scene 1)
- `campus-energy.mp4` — students walking, campus life, energy (Scene 2)

Recommended specs:
- H.264 MP4
- 1920×1080 minimum
- 10–30 second seamless loops
- Muted (autoplay requirement)

The app falls back to cinematic still images until these files are present.
